<SCENARIO VER="105">
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体春花怒り閉じ.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<TXSPN>"You don't understand! You're just a bystander in the end! I'm the only one who's been suffering, and all you did was stand and watch!"<PG>
{CHANGECG "立木三日" "グラフィック\イラスト\春花\合体春花怒り.gal" "REPEAT" "1" "100" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
"What do you know!? All you ever did was watch! Don't talk big when you don't even know how I feel!"
{PAUSE ""}
